<metadata><name>High Divide Loop (from Trillium Lake Sno-Park)</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:147-3: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.285259" lon="-121.727970"><ele>1156.8</ele><name>Trillium Lake Sno-Park</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:trillium-lake-sno-park (OSM parking way/148019331); confidence: high; pdf_page: 143; book_elev_ft: 3830</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.280208" lon="-121.733236"><ele>1103.1</ele><name>Airstrip junction</name><desc>source: as in or-vielbig-2e_142-2 / 147-4; confidence: high; pdf_page: 144</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.270371" lon="-121.732742"><ele>1103.9</ele><name>Campground junction</name><desc>source: OSM node 37397443, as 147-4; confidence: high; pdf_page: 146</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.247584" lon="-121.738954"><ele>1191.7</ele><name>Jefferson Viewpoint</name><desc>source: OSM node 37598733, as 147-4; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 149; book_elev_ft: 3940; quote: Ski to Jefferson Viewpoint and enter and descend partway the Telemark Hill clearcut, bearing left</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.242187" lon="-121.739917"><ele>1139.3</ele><name>Top of the Jefferson Viewpoint Cutoff</name><desc>source: OSM node 2452545090, east end of unnamed track way/237337446 (the only old road from the clearcut down to the Lower Ridge road, where map 33 draws the cutoff); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 149; quote: to locate the Jefferson Viewpoint Cutoff Trail (unmarked), the start of which may be partially obscured by second growth</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.240115" lon="-121.746968"><ele>1097.4</ele><name>Cutoff meets the Lower Ridge road</name><desc>source: OSM node 2452545072, where track way/237337446 joins Trillium Lake Loop Road; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 149; quote: Ski this old logging road to the Lower Ridge road</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.229466" lon="-121.744614"><ele>1133.2</ele><name>Big Bend</name><desc>source: OSM node 2452545085, as 150-2; confidence: high; pdf_page: 149; quote: then ski around Big Bend</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.243053" lon="-121.733122"><ele>1211.2</ele><name>High Divide</name><desc>source: OSM node 2452534627 (Lost Man Trail junction), as 147-4; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 149; book_elev_ft: 4040; quote: over the high point of the High Divide road, and back to Jefferson Viewpoint</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.247584" lon="-121.738954"><ele>1191.7</ele><name>Jefferson Viewpoint (loop closed)</name><desc>source: as above; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 149</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.270371" lon="-121.732742"><ele>1103.9</ele><name>Campground junction (return)</name><desc>source: as above; confidence: high</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.280208" lon="-121.733236"><ele>1103.1</ele><name>Airstrip junction (return)</name><desc>source: as above; confidence: high</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.285259" lon="-121.727970"><ele>1156.8</ele><name>Trillium Lake Sno-Park (finish)</name><desc>source: as start; confidence: high</desc></wpt>
